        <mxCell id="c5" value="Target design from docs/architecture and docs/plan at origin/phase/2-sprint-2-work, read 2026-10-16. Components only, no arrows (Figure 4.6 style): import rules are in the panel at the bottom; code status is in phase-2-architecture.md." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=#555555;fontStyle=0;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="78" width="1300" height="18" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c6" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#2e75b6&quot;&gt;Legend:&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; Phase 0–1 foundation (plain dark text)&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#b45309&quot;&gt;New in Phase 2 (orange bold)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;i&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#7030a0&quot;&gt;Track B client work (purple italic) [S1] or [S2]&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;† MVP-if-time in the docs&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;font color=&quot;#2e75b6&quot;&gt;blue = layer and group labels&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#9aa5b1;strokeWidth=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=4;spacingBottom=4;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=13;fontColor=#1a1a1a;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="104" width="1300" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c7" value="Player and browser surface" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=bottom;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#2e75b6;fontStyle=0;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="150" width="1300" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c8" value="Player (one human Legend) · keyboard and mouse · game canvas stack (terrain, entities and overlay canvases; offscreen minimap canvas in the HUD slot)&lt;br&gt;React DOM (menus and HUD over the canvas host) · URL flags: ?dev=1 (developer menu), &lt;i&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#7030a0&quot;&gt;?memory (memory storage) [S2]&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/i&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f2f4f5;strokeColor=#2e6fb7;strokeWidth=2;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=4;spacingBottom=4;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=13;fontColor=#1a1a1a;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="172" width="1300" height="52" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c9" value="L4 Presentation — React UI (ui/, styles/)" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=bottom;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#2e75b6;fontStyle=0;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="236" width="770" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c10" value="L4 Presentation — Canvas views (game/views/)" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=bottom;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#2e75b6;fontStyle=0;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="810" y="236" width="510" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c11" value="&lt;i&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#7030a0&quot;&gt;App (session phase → screen registry) [S1]&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#2e75b6&quot;&gt;Screens:&lt;/font&gt; &lt;i&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#7030a0&quot;&gt;MainMenuScreen · match-flow screens (loading, character select, pre-launch, match loading) · SettingsScreen (press-to-bind) · AboutScreen [S1]&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/i&gt; · &lt;i&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#7030a0&quot;&gt;LoadoutScreen · ProfileScreen [S2]&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/i&gt; · MatchScreen (viewport + HUD)&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#2e75b6&quot;&gt;HUD:&lt;/font&gt; &lt;i&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#7030a0&quot;&gt;PauseOverlay (with the settings screen embedded) [S1]&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/i&gt; · &lt;i&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#7030a0&quot;&gt;HUD draft placeholders: HealthBar · AetherBar · XpBar / LevelBadge · AbilityBar · MinimapPanel · MatchClock · Scoreboard · Announcer · NameTag [S1]&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/i&gt; · PerfOverlay v1 · DeveloperMenu v0, &lt;i&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#7030a0&quot;&gt;v1 [S2]&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/i&gt; · &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#b45309&quot;&gt;HealthBar for the selected structure (one segment per shield bar) · Announcer events (tower razed, point captured)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#2e75b6&quot;&gt;Shared:&lt;/font&gt; &lt;i&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#7030a0&quot;&gt;ui/components/ (KeyGlyph, Prompt, Button and shared layout pieces) · ui/strings.ts [S1]&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/i&gt; · styles/global.css (design tokens and reset) · &lt;font color=&quot;#2e75b6&quot;&gt;library:&lt;/font&gt; React (ADR 0004)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f2f4f5;strokeColor=#2e6fb7;strokeWidth=2;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=4;spacingBottom=4;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=13;fontColor=#1a1a1a;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="258" width="770" height="156" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c12" value="SceneView (the one draw order; interpolates the previous and current snapshot)&lt;br&gt;ViewRegistry + defaultViewRegistry (kind → family → default view)&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#2e75b6&quot;&gt;EntityViews:&lt;/font&gt; DefaultEntityView · LegendView · MobView · &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#b45309&quot;&gt;StructureView / per-kind structure views (stacked shield-bar segments, gate and wall states)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;TerrainView (pre-rendered terrain chunks, dirty flags)&lt;br&gt;MinimapView (same snapshot drawn smaller) + &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#b45309&quot;&gt;structure and obstacle glyphs, capture-progress ring&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f2f4f5;strokeColor=#2e6fb7;strokeWidth=2;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=4;spacingBottom=4;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=13;fontColor=#1a1a1a;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="810" y="258" width="510" height="156" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c13" value="L3 Application (apps/client/src: main.tsx, game/ except engine/ and views/, bridge/, data/)" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=bottom;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=16;fontColor=#2e75b6;fontStyle=0;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="426" width="1300" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="frame-l3" value="" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#2e6fb7;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="450" width="1300" height="289" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c14" value="Composition and session (main.tsx, game/)" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=bottom;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=14;fontColor=#2e75b6;fontStyle=0;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="36" y="458" width="361" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c15" value="Input mapping (game/input/)" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=bottom;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=14;fontColor=#2e75b6;fontStyle=0;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="397" y="458" width="231" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c16" value="Bridge (bridge/)" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=bottom;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=14;fontColor=#2e75b6;fontStyle=0;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="628" y="458" width="366" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c17" value="Data facades (data/, L3 part)" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=bottom;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=14;fontColor=#2e75b6;fontStyle=0;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="994" y="458" width="326" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c18" value="main.tsx (app composition root: builds the controllers, constructs the storage adapter and injects it, mounts &amp;lt;App/&amp;gt;)&lt;br&gt;Match (match composition root; LoopTarget: tick, render, destroy)&lt;br&gt;GameCanvas.tsx (owns the canvas elements)&lt;br&gt;MatchBridge (game → UI: throttled hud-state and match-clock, match-ended, diagnostic) + &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#b45309&quot;&gt;announce events&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#7030a0&quot;&gt;SessionController + one SessionState per SessionPhase (boot … results) [S1]&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#7030a0&quot;&gt;SettingsController (game/settings/) [S1]&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/i&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f2f4f5;strokeColor=#2e6fb7;strokeWidth=2;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=4;spacingBottom=4;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=13;fontColor=#1a1a1a;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="36" y="479" width="345" height="248" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c19" value="keybindings.ts (DEFAULT_CHORDS, PRESETS: the only place a default key is written)&lt;br&gt;InputMapper (InputSnapshot → ActionState → InputIntent)&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#7030a0&quot;&gt;BindingResolver (chord index, conflict check) [S1]&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#b45309&quot;&gt;default chords for the turret actions (manual control) †&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f2f4f5;strokeColor=#2e6fb7;strokeWidth=2;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=4;spacingBottom=4;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=13;fontColor=#1a1a1a;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="397" y="479" width="215" height="248" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c20" value="store.ts (combineSlices) · &lt;font color=&quot;#2e75b6&quot;&gt;library:&lt;/font&gt; Redux Toolkit (ADR 0004)&lt;br&gt;eventBus.ts (TypedEventBus&amp;lt;BridgeEventMap&amp;gt;)&lt;br&gt;events.ts (BridgeEventMap, UiIntent, SessionPhase, MenuRoute)&lt;br&gt;connectBusToStore (bus event → slice dispatch) · hooks.ts (typed hooks)&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#2e75b6&quot;&gt;Slices:&lt;/font&gt; matchSlice · diagnosticsSlice · &lt;i&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#7030a0&quot;&gt;sessionSlice · settingsSlice · loadingSlice · contentSlice · hudSlice · matchSetupSlice [S1]&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/i&gt; · &lt;i&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#7030a0&quot;&gt;persistenceSlice · profileSlice [S2]&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;Binding.types.ts (INPUT_ACTIONS ids, Binding, InputChord) + &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#b45309&quot;&gt;turret InputAction ids †&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; · &lt;i&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#7030a0&quot;&gt;chordKey.ts [S1]&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/i&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f2f4f5;strokeColor=#2e6fb7;strokeWidth=2;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=4;spacingBottom=4;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=13;fontColor=#1a1a1a;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="628" y="479" width="350" height="248" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c21" value="&lt;i&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#7030a0&quot;&gt;PersistenceController (settings-only facade) [S1]&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/i&gt;, &lt;i&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#7030a0&quot;&gt;full facade + unitOfWork [S2]&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#7030a0&quot;&gt;StorageAdapter port (owned by L3) [S1]&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#2e75b6&quot;&gt;Repositories:&lt;/font&gt; &lt;i&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#7030a0&quot;&gt;SettingsRepository + readOrQuarantine [S1]&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/i&gt; · &lt;i&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#7030a0&quot;&gt;ProfileRepository · LoadoutRepository · MatchHistoryRepository · ReplayRepository [S2]&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#7030a0&quot;&gt;dto/* and schema/migrations.ts: settings + quarantine [S1]&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/i&gt;, &lt;i&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#7030a0&quot;&gt;all v1 stores [S2]&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#7030a0&quot;&gt;EvictionPolicy (OldestReplaysFirst) · StorageError · profileExport.ts [S2]&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;SinkLogger (implements the core Logger) + LogSink port" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f2f4f5;strokeColor=#2e6fb7;strokeWidth=2;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=4;spacingBottom=4;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=13;fontColor=#1a1a1a;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="994" y="479" width="310" height="248" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c22" value="L2 Domain — @eternalus/core (packages/core)" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=bottom;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=16;fontColor=#2e75b6;fontStyle=0;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="751" width="1300" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c23" value="L2.1 Facade and public API" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=bottom;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=14;fontColor=#2e75b6;fontStyle=0;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="36" y="785" width="1268" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c24" value="Simulation (+ SimulationOptions): enqueueCommand · step · snapshot · on · hash — core's composition root&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;index.ts: the public API, the only import surface of @eternalus/core" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f2f4f5;strokeColor=#2e6fb7;strokeWidth=2;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=4;spacingBottom=4;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=13;fontColor=#1a1a1a;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="36" y="806" width="1268" height="46" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c25" value="L2.2 Tick pipeline (systems/)" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=bottom;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=14;fontColor=#2e75b6;fontStyle=0;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="36" y="862" width="1268" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c26" value="System + SystemContext · SystemPipeline · defaultSystemPipeline (systems never call each other; they talk through GameEvents)&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#2e75b6&quot;&gt;Order fixed by the docs:&lt;/font&gt; CommandApplySystem first · MovementSystem (+ &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#b45309&quot;&gt;swept projectiles&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;) → CollisionSystem (+ &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#b45309&quot;&gt;projectiles, breakable walls&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;) · DeathSystem (+ &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#b45309&quot;&gt;names the killer&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;) → InvariantSystem → SnapshotSystem last&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#2e75b6&quot;&gt;Position not fixed by the docs:&lt;/font&gt; &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#b45309&quot;&gt;CombatSystem v1 · StatusEffectSystem · StructureSystem · CaptureSystem · SpawnSystem v1&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f2f4f5;strokeColor=#2e6fb7;strokeWidth=2;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=4;spacingBottom=4;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=13;fontColor=#1a1a1a;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="36" y="883" width="1268" height="82" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c27" value="L2.3 Rules services: combat, controllers, diagnostics" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=bottom;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=14;fontColor=#2e75b6;fontStyle=0;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="36" y="975" width="1268" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c28" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#2e75b6&quot;&gt;Combat (combat/):&lt;/font&gt; &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#b45309&quot;&gt;DamagePipeline (the one path to Health) · DamageSource · DeathResolver · StatusEffectRuntime&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#2e75b6&quot;&gt;Controllers (ai/):&lt;/font&gt; Controller interface · PlayerController · &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#b45309&quot;&gt;TurretController (sticky target, predictive aim, ammo switch)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#2e75b6&quot;&gt;Diagnostics (diagnostics/):&lt;/font&gt; Invariant + InvariantRunner (light every tick, heavy every N) · Logger port (LogRecord, MemoryLogger, NullLogger) · DiagnosticEvent map · replay harness + randomCommands · &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#b45309&quot;&gt;soak harness (npm run test:soak)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#2e75b6&quot;&gt;Invariants (each …Invariant):&lt;/font&gt; NoRemovalWithoutCause · HealthWithinBounds · FiniteTransforms · UniqueEntityIds · DanglingReferences · TickAdvancedOnce · &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#b45309&quot;&gt;NoDeathWithoutKiller · NoPassThroughUnbreakable · NoEntityInsideUnbreakableCollider · ShieldBarsMatchLivingTowers · BreakabilityMatchesRule · GateFootprintMatchesState · TeamUnitCap · CaptureProgressBounds&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f2f4f5;strokeColor=#2e6fb7;strokeWidth=2;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=4;spacingBottom=4;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=13;fontColor=#1a1a1a;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="36" y="996" width="1268" height="104" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c29" value="L2.4 Game state and commands" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=bottom;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=14;fontColor=#2e75b6;fontStyle=0;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="36" y="1110" width="1268" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c30" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#2e75b6&quot;&gt;State (state/):&lt;/font&gt; GameState (aggregate root) · EntityStore (remove(id, cause) is the only way out) · GameEvents + GameEventMap (+ &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#b45309&quot;&gt;structure, combat, capture, spawn and terrain events&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;) · Snapshot / EntitySnapshot · StateHasher (FNV-1a)&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#2e75b6&quot;&gt;Commands (commands/):&lt;/font&gt; Command union · CommandQueue · applyCommand · CommandHandlers + defaultCommandHandlers · &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#b45309&quot;&gt;attack-target handler · developer-menu spawn-from-origin command (per-team cap from GameConfig)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f2f4f5;strokeColor=#2e6fb7;strokeWidth=2;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=4;spacingBottom=4;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=13;fontColor=#1a1a1a;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="36" y="1131" width="1268" height="82" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c31" value="L2.5 Entities, structures and components" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=bottom;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=14;fontColor=#2e75b6;fontStyle=0;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="36" y="1223" width="1268" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c32" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#2e75b6&quot;&gt;Families (entities/):&lt;/font&gt; Entity (root) · Unit: Legend (Warrior placeholder), Mob (LightMob) · &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#b45309&quot;&gt;Structure (abstract) · Zone (abstract) · Obstacle (data-driven kinds, breakable / unbreakable, felled trees †) · Projectile + ProjectilePool&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#2e75b6&quot;&gt;Structures:&lt;/font&gt; &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#b45309&quot;&gt;Stronghold · SpawnerTower · BuffTower · WallSegment · Gate · Turret · Camp · Cathedral&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;font color=&quot;#2e75b6&quot;&gt;Zones:&lt;/font&gt; &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#b45309&quot;&gt;CapturePoint&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#2e75b6&quot;&gt;Factory and registries:&lt;/font&gt; EntityFactory · EntityRegistry + defaultEntityRegistry (+ &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#b45309&quot;&gt;structure lines, spawn from MapDefinition slots&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;) · &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#b45309&quot;&gt;StrategyRegistry + defaultStrategyRegistry&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#2e75b6&quot;&gt;Strategies:&lt;/font&gt; &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#b45309&quot;&gt;AttackStrategy: MeleeAttackStrategy, RangedProjectileAttackStrategy, Sentinel sprint-through rule † · TargetingStrategy: NearestEnemyTargetingStrategy, StickyTurretTargetingStrategy&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#2e75b6&quot;&gt;Components (components/):&lt;/font&gt; Transform · Health (+ &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#b45309&quot;&gt;layered shield bars&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;) · Movement · TeamMembership · Collider (+ &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#b45309&quot;&gt;convex-polygon footprint&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;) · Vision · &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#b45309&quot;&gt;Combat · StatusEffects · Spawner · Capturable · GateState · TurretState · Aura&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f2f4f5;strokeColor=#2e6fb7;strokeWidth=2;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=4;spacingBottom=4;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=13;fontColor=#1a1a1a;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="36" y="1244" width="1268" height="118" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c33" value="L2.6 World map and physics" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=bottom;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=14;fontColor=#2e75b6;fontStyle=0;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="36" y="1372" width="1268" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c34" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#2e75b6&quot;&gt;Map (map/):&lt;/font&gt; MapGenerator (GameConfig + seed → MapDefinition) · MapBuilder (+ &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#b45309&quot;&gt;wall-turret slots, spawn origins&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;) · LaneShape + ProfileLaneShape · LaneGeometry · symmetry.ts&lt;br&gt;MapDefinition · MapFeature · MapFeatureKind · MinimapGlyph (map contract types, in content/maps/) · WorldMap (walkability grid, footprint stamps; + &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#b45309&quot;&gt;unstamp / restamp, terrain-changed dirty rectangles&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;)&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#2e75b6&quot;&gt;Physics (physics/):&lt;/font&gt; SpatialHash (broad phase) · StaticColliderIndex · shapes Circle, ConvexPolygon · sat.ts (SAT + MTV) · sweptTests.ts (+ &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#b45309&quot;&gt;projectiles&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;) · CollisionResolver (ResolverPhases) · Kinematics" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f2f4f5;strokeColor=#2e6fb7;strokeWidth=2;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=4;spacingBottom=4;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=13;fontColor=#1a1a1a;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="36" y="1393" width="1268" height="66" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c35" value="L2.7 Content and config" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=bottom;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=14;fontColor=#2e75b6;fontStyle=0;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="36" y="1469" width="1268" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c36" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#2e75b6&quot;&gt;Config (config/):&lt;/font&gt; GameConfig (MapConfig, MatchConfig, LimitsConfig) · validateGameConfig · createDefaultGameConfig · ConfigValidationError · &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#b45309&quot;&gt;limits.maxUnitsPerTeam enforced · match.capturePoints · match.timeline (MatchTimelineEntry) · match.hordeSpawnIntervalSeconds&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#2e75b6&quot;&gt;Content (content/):&lt;/font&gt; ContentCatalogue · loadDefaultContent · ContentValidator + defaultContentRules · LegendDefinition (placeholder Warrior) · MobDefinition (training-dummy) · MapLayout · MapPreset (map-1)&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#2e75b6&quot;&gt;Phase 2 content:&lt;/font&gt; &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#b45309&quot;&gt;StructureDefinition (shield multipliers, BreakabilityRule data, damageMultipliers by damageClass, gate timing, gate fire †) · AmmoDefinition (bolt-default, bolt-heavy) · ProjectileDefinition · ObstacleDefinition + FellEffect † · zone radii and rates · StatusEffectDefinition (bleed, concussion, stun, blind, enraged, crushed) · SpawnTable · SpawnWave · GuardPlan&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#2e75b6&quot;&gt;Teams (teams/):&lt;/font&gt; PlayableTeam · Team" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f2f4f5;strokeColor=#2e6fb7;strokeWidth=2;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=4;spacingBottom=4;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=13;fontColor=#1a1a1a;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="36" y="1490" width="1268" height="128" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c37" value="L2.8 Core foundation (utils/) and the Rng port" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=bottom;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=14;fontColor=#2e75b6;fontStyle=0;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="36" y="1628" width="1268" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c38" value="Rng port + SeededRandom (sfc32) · Vec2 / vec2.ts · geometry.ts · deterministicMath.ts · fnv1a.ts · IdGenerator · RingBuffer · ObjectPool base · compareById" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f2f4f5;strokeColor=#2e6fb7;strokeWidth=2;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=4;spacingBottom=4;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=13;fontColor=#1a1a1a;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="36" y="1649" width="1268" height="46" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c39" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#a4262c&quot;&gt;L2 NEVER DEPENDS ON L1: L2 never imports L1 (nor anything under apps/). game/engine/ never imports @eternalus/core; the adapters under data/ import core types only (import type).&lt;br&gt;L3 wires L2 and L1 together: Match and main.tsx pass the adapters in by constructor injection.&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#a4262c;strokeWidth=2;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=4;spacingBottom=4;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=13;fontColor=#1a1a1a;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="80" y="1721" width="1180" height="58" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c40" value="L1 Infrastructure — Mini engine (game/engine/; generic, no game vocabulary)" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=bottom;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#2e75b6;fontStyle=0;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="1791" width="800" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c41" value="L1 Infrastructure — Platform adapters in data/ (L1 in role)" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=bottom;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#2e75b6;fontStyle=0;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="840" y="1791" width="480" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c42" value="GameLoop + LoopTarget (fixed-tick accumulator, clamp, interpolation alpha) · FrameScheduler port: RafFrameScheduler / FakeFrameScheduler&lt;br&gt;Renderer port: Canvas2dRenderer (the only code that touches the 2D context; layers, DPR) / RecordingRenderer&lt;br&gt;Camera + Projection port (+ MinimapProjection) · InputDevice port: KeyboardDevice, MouseDevice / FakeInputDevice&lt;br&gt;Clock port: PerformanceClock / FakeClock · PerfMonitor (marks and measures, frame histogram)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f2f4f5;strokeColor=#2e6fb7;strokeWidth=2;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=4;spacingBottom=4;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=13;fontColor=#1a1a1a;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="1813" width="800" height="94" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c43" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#2e75b6&quot;&gt;Storage adapters (data/persistence/):&lt;/font&gt; &lt;i&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#7030a0&quot;&gt;MemoryStorageAdapter [S1]&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/i&gt; · &lt;i&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#7030a0&quot;&gt;IndexedDbStorageAdapter + idbPromises.ts [S2]&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#2e75b6&quot;&gt;Log sinks (data/logging/):&lt;/font&gt; ConsoleSink (the only console user) · RingBufferSink&lt;br&gt;They import @eternalus/core types only (import type)." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f2f4f5;strokeColor=#2e6fb7;strokeWidth=2;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=4;spacingBottom=4;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=13;fontColor=#1a1a1a;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="840" y="1813" width="480" height="94" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c44" value="Browser platform and storage" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=bottom;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#2e75b6;fontStyle=0;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="1919" width="1300" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c45" value="requestAnimationFrame · Canvas 2D (HTMLCanvasElement, CanvasRenderingContext2D, devicePixelRatio, ResizeObserver) · DOM input events (KeyboardEvent.code, pointer events, contextmenu / auxclick, blur / visibilitychange)&lt;br&gt;performance.now / mark / measure, PerformanceObserver · console · &lt;i&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#7030a0&quot;&gt;navigator.storage (persist, persisted, estimate) [S2]&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#7030a0&quot;&gt;IndexedDB database eternalus: profiles · loadouts · settings · matches · replays · meta · quarantine [S2]&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/i&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f2f4f5;strokeColor=#2e6fb7;strokeWidth=2;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=4;spacingBottom=4;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=13;fontColor=#1a1a1a;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="1941" width="1300" height="76" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c46" value="Import rules (01 §2, 02 §2–§3) — what the bands above do not show" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=bottom;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=14;fontColor=#2e75b6;fontStyle=0;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="2037" width="860" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c47" value="Not a runtime layer" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=bottom;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=14;fontColor=#2e75b6;fontStyle=0;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="900" y="2037" width="420" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c48" value="• ui/ → bridge/, ui/, styles/ only; never game/, data/ or @eternalus/core&lt;br&gt;• game/views/ → core as import type only (Snapshot types) + game/engine/ port types (Renderer, Camera); views never mutate&lt;br&gt;• Match, SessionController, game/input/ → core, game/engine/, game/views/, game/input/, bridge/, data/ (never ui/)&lt;br&gt;• The composition roots' upward imports: Match → game/views/; main.tsx → ui/App.tsx (the only place game/ and ui/ meet)&lt;br&gt;• game/settings/ → core, game/input/, bridge/ (it reaches persistence through a structural port)&lt;br&gt;• bridge/ and data/ (facades and adapters) → core types only (import type) and their own folder&lt;br&gt;• game/engine/ (L1) → browser APIs and itself only; never @eternalus/core, views, input, Match, bridge/, ui/ or data/&lt;br&gt;• packages/core (L2) → itself only; never anything under apps/ (not even L1), React, Redux, DOM, Canvas or Node&lt;br&gt;• client → core only through @eternalus/core (index.ts), never a deep path" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#2e6fb7;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=4;spacingBottom=4;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=13;fontColor=#1a1a1a;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="2059" width="860" height="178" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c49" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#2e75b6&quot;&gt;Development harness (Phase 0)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;npm run check: format, no-JS, lint, typecheck, knip, tests, build, docs check&lt;br&gt;git hooks · agent skills · reviewer agents · CI&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Phase 0 built docs and tooling only, no game code." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#9aa5b1;strokeWidth=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=4;spacingBottom=4;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=13;fontColor=#1a1a1a;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="900" y="2059" width="420" height="178" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>
